### Motivation
- Improve the visual balance on narrow mobile screens by increasing the site logo so it reads well alongside the Menu control and the prominent header CTAs without changing desktop/tablet layouts. 
- Preserve the sticky header, mobile navigation behavior, accessibility attributes, natural aspect ratio, and image fidelity while keeping the header compact and preventing wrapping or overflow.

